    "PAC-202E DoD and user connected boxing requirements"
  ],
  "implementation": [
    "Four shared-rig style profiles: neutral flex; mobile outboxer with extended lead guard and fast return; compact swarmer with quick low steps and short arcs; planted slugger with delayed release and heavier return. No combat timing/stat changes.",
    "Yuri and Sam have broader shoulder/limb silhouettes, with fixed bone lengths and head/body contact surfaces. Named roster/encounter identities reset on reused actor nodes.",
    "Marta retains high guard and hands-down invitation, with her authored 15-degree left glove adjustment during Mirror arming.",
    "Scripted VM steps are drawn over 12 active ticks. Contact eligibility uses physical combat geometry, with resolved pre-shove geometry held through hitstop. Inside arcs avoid shoulder/elbow reversals."
  ],
